WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.380
Welcome back, champ!

2
00:00:04.380 --> 00:00:16.280
Last time: Find face → Mark points → Draw

3
00:00:16.280 --> 00:00:24.750
Chapter 5 · AI in Games

4
00:00:24.750 --> 00:00:33.100
How do game characters know where you are?

5
00:00:33.100 --> 00:00:41.610
Meet Riya, playing Mango Maze

6
00:00:41.610 --> 00:00:51.820
Collect mangoes… but watch out for Sheru!

7
00:00:51.820 --> 00:01:01.690
Too close! Sheru starts chasing!

8
00:01:01.690 --> 00:01:14.930
Is someone hiding inside, moving Sheru?

9
00:01:14.930 --> 00:01:24.110
No one inside! Sheru follows rules.

10
00:01:24.110 --> 00:01:34.330
The PLAYER: the character you control

11
00:01:34.330 --> 00:01:43.670
NPC = non-player character

12
00:01:43.670 --> 00:01:56.070
Guards · Ghosts · Shopkeepers: all NPCs

13
00:01:56.070 --> 00:02:07.990
IF something happens, THEN do this

14
00:02:07.990 --> 00:02:18.320
If player is near → chase. Else → patrol.

15
00:02:18.320 --> 00:02:25.920
ELSE means: otherwise, if not

16
00:02:25.920 --> 00:02:37.050
Chase: go to the player · Patrol: back & forth

17
00:02:37.050 --> 00:02:52.930
Is the player near? No… No… YES! Chase!

18
00:02:52.930 --> 00:03:02.690
Checks many times a second, like filters!

19
00:03:02.690 --> 00:03:16.620
Not alive! Just clear rules, followed fast

20
00:03:16.620 --> 00:03:24.800
Steps a computer follows = an ALGORITHM

21
00:03:24.800 --> 00:03:38.650
Check → Yes: chase · No: patrol → again

22
00:03:38.650 --> 00:03:45.430
Game rules are algorithms!

23
00:03:45.430 --> 00:03:51.610
Rules for lots of game things!

24
00:03:51.610 --> 00:03:59.590
Coin: if touched → disappear, +1 point

25
00:03:59.590 --> 00:04:03.870
Door: if player has the key → open

26
00:04:03.870 --> 00:04:14.660
Ghost: if player eats a power berry → run

27
00:04:14.660 --> 00:04:37.720
Match each character to its rule!

28
00:04:37.720 --> 00:04:49.170
Mango: +1 · Gate: key opens · Owl: hoots

29
00:04:49.170 --> 00:05:10.250
Which guard rules are better: A or B?

30
00:05:10.250 --> 00:05:22.670
A! It reacts and keeps watch. B just sleeps.

31
00:05:22.670 --> 00:05:29.500
Project: design your own maze guard!

32
00:05:29.500 --> 00:05:38.960
1 · Draw a tiny maze, pick your guard

33
00:05:38.960 --> 00:05:47.430
2 · Write 2 rules: If near… Else…

34
00:05:47.430 --> 00:06:01.930
3 · Act it out with a friend, fix, try again

35
00:06:01.930 --> 00:06:05.880
Your turn: practice check

36
00:06:05.880 --> 00:06:15.130
Write one rule for a coin that disappears

37
00:06:15.130 --> 00:06:26.010
If player touches coin → disappear, +1

38
00:06:26.010 --> 00:06:34.060
NPCs follow if/then rules

39
00:06:34.060 --> 00:06:38.310
If near, chase. Else, patrol.

40
00:06:38.310 --> 00:06:44.260
No one inside: just clear, fast rules

41
00:06:44.260 --> 00:06:46.480
Game rules are algorithms

42
00:06:46.480 --> 00:06:59.380
Chapter 5 done · Unit 3 complete!

43
00:06:59.380 --> 00:07:06.180
Next: Quiz · Tap Finish
